00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
The Rig is a action, horror, science fiction film directed by Peter Atencio.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
In the midst of a tropical storm, the crew of an offshore oil rig must survive
the rampage of a creature after invading its undersea habitat.

